<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}</p>

<p>Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},</p>

<p>Thank you for assisting with the medical emergency during your flight QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}. Our Customer Service Manager has expressed their appreciation for the support you provided.</p>

<p>Our Cabin Crew are trained to handle basic medical situations, however, on this occasion our customer needed professional help, so your expertise and contribution was invaluable to us.</p>

<p><strong>A little something from us</strong><br />
To show our gratitude, we'd love to offer you a gift of <strong><em>&lt;points/voucher&gt;</em></strong>.<br />
<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/join-now.html/code/FAMILYFREE">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.<br />
<br />
Thank you again for your assistance and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
